tivating <i>ERBB2</i> Mutations and ER Results in Synthetic Lethality of ER+/HER2 Mutant Breast Cancer", "title": "Combined Blockade of Activating <i>ERBB2</i> Mutations and ER Results in Synthetic Lethality of ER+/HER2 Mutant Breast Cancer", "journal": "Clin. Cancer Res.", "pages": "277-289", "pubMedIdentifier": 30314968, "volume": 25, "year": 2019, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/30314968", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 9646957, "displayName": "Integrated genomic analyses of ovarian carcinoma", "title": "Integrated genomic analyses of ovarian carcinoma", "journal": "Nature", "pages": "609-15", "pubMedIdentifier": 21720365, "volume": 474, "year": 2011, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21720365", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "species": [{"dbId": 48887, "displayName": "Homo sapiens", "name": ["Homo sapiens", "H. sapiens", "Hs", "human", "man"], "taxId": "9606", "crossReference": [{"dbId": 72938, "displayName": "NCBI_taxonomy:9606", "databaseName": "NCBI Taxonomy", "identifier": "9606", "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Taxonomy/Browser/wwwtax.cgi?mode=Info&id=9606", "className": "DatabaseIdentifier", "schemaClass": "DatabaseIdentifier"}], "abbreviation": "HSA", "className": "Species", "schemaClass": "Species"}], "hasDiagram": true, "hasEHLD": false, "lastUpdatedDate": "2023-06-07", "hasEvent": [9665032], "schemaClass": "Pathway", "className": "Pathway"}], "precedingEvent": [{"dbId": 9665034, "displayName": "Phosphorylated heterodimers of ERBB2 KD mutants and EGFR bind PLCG1", "stId": "R-HSA-9665034", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-9665034.2", "isInDisease": true, "isInferred": false, "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["Phosphorylated heterodimers of ERBB2 KD mutants and EGFR bind PLCG1"], "releaseDate": "2019-12-10", "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "crossReference": [12020745], "followingEvent": [9665032], "literatureReference": [9646964, 9646962, 9646435], "species": [48887], "isChimeric": false, "category": "binding", "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "Reaction"}], "literatureReference": [9646964, 9646962, 9646435], "reviewed": [{"dbId": 9662685, "displayName": "Kancha, Rama Krishna, 2019-09-16", "dateTime": "2019-09-16 00:00:00", "className": "InstanceEdit", "schemaClass": "InstanceEdit"}], "species": [48887], "summation": [{"dbId": 9665041, "displayName": "It is assumed that the following EGFR-binding ERBB2 mutants ...", "text": "It is assumed that the following EGFR-binding ERBB2 mutants that were shown to activate PLCG1 (PLCgamma-1) signaling, evidenced by activating phosphorylation of PLCG1, recruit and phosphorylate PLCG1:<br><br>ERBB2 L755S (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 I767M (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 D769H (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 D769Y (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 V777L (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 G778_P780dup (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 V842I (Bose et al. 2013);<br>ERBB2 H878Y (Hu, Hu et al. 2015, Hu, Wan et al. 2015);<br>ERBB2 R896C (Bose et al. 2013);<br><br>It is assumed that, like the wild type ERBB2:EGFR heterodimer, phosphorylated heterodimers of these ERBB2 KD mutants and EGFR recruit PLCG1. <br><br>ERBB2 L755_T759del does not activate PLCG1 signaling (Bose et al. 2013).<br><br>Activation of PLCG1 downstream of the following PLCG1 mutants has not been studied and  they are annotated as candidates: <br><br>ERBB2 L755M<br>ERBB2 L755W<br>ERBB2 D769N<br>ERBB2 V777M<br>ERBB2 V777E <br>ERBB2 V842E<br>ERBB2 H878R<br>ERBB2 R896H", "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "updateTrackers": [{"dbId": 9835737, "displayName": "Update Tracker - [Reaction:9665032] Phosphorylated heterodimers of ERBB2 KD mutants and EGFR phosphorylate PLCG1 - v85:[modifyText]", "action": ["modifyText"], "updatedInstance": [96650